{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Loyal Spark — Onchain Loyalty Protocol",
    "version": "2.1.0",
    "description": "AI-agent-native loyalty protocol on Base L2. REST: 23 authenticated routes plus public GET /vouchers/status. MCP: 28 tools at /loyalty-mcp. Create loyalty programs, mint tokens, POST /earn for purchase cashback, manage rewards, P2P marketplace, CDP server wallets.",
    "x-guidance": "Loyal Spark — Base L2 (chain 8453).\n\nAuthentication: Almost every path requires header x-api-key: lsk_... from https://loyalspark.online/merchant → AI Agents. Exception: GET /vouchers/status is public (no key).\n\nProgram lifecycle scopes: POST /programs, /register-program, /update-program-config, /activate-program, /program-status accept mint OR create_program.\n\nTypical flow:\n1. GET /me — profile and scopes\n2. POST /programs — factory calldata to deploy ERC-20\n3. POST /register-program — persist program (optional cashback_rate, points_per_dollar)\n4. POST /update-program-config — change default cashback / points-per-dollar later\n5. POST /activate-program — unpause + enable mint calldata\n6. POST /program-status — set active in DB\n7. POST /mint or POST /earn — distribute points\n8. POST /rewards — catalog\n9. GET /analytics — metrics\n\nMCP mirrors REST with 28 tools (see repo loyalty-mcp/index.ts). Server wallets: Supabase function agent-wallet (not agent-api).\n\nDocs: https://loyalspark.online/api-docs · llms: https://loyalspark.online/llms.txt · agent manifest: https://loyalspark.online/.well-known/agent.json",
    "x-mcp": {
      "url": "https://bzxmejzssxjazswgwqqs.supabase.co/functions/v1/loyalty-mcp",
      "transport": "streamable-http",
      "tool_count": 28
    },
    "x-x402-discovery": {
      "wellKnownResources": "https://loyalspark.online/.well-known/x402",
      "gatewayBaseUrl": "https://bzxmejzssxjazswgwqqs.supabase.co/functions/v1/x402-gateway",
      "note": "Full list of x402 resource URLs for scanners (x402scan DISCOVERY.md); same paths as agent-api + mcp-tools/* + recipient-mcp-tools/* + recipient-api/*."
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://bzxmejzssxjazswgwqqs.supabase.co/functions/v1/agent-api",
      "description": "Loyal Spark agent REST API (x-api-key required except where noted per-path)"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://bzxmejzssxjazswgwqqs.supabase.co/functions/v1/mpp-gateway",
      "description": "MPP gateway — HTTP 402 pay-per-request proxy to agent-api"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://bzxmejzssxjazswgwqqs.supabase.co/functions/v1/x402-gateway",
      "description": "x402 Bazaar — HTTP 402 pay-per-request (agent REST + MCP + recipient); discovery https://loyalspark.online/.well-known/x402"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "apiKey": []
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "apiKey": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
